charlie[thinking]: Can I tell you something about them? The group. It's not a secret. They just don't know it.
charlie: When I joined, I did my first-week thing. Names, snacks, jokes. Full power. I was *exhausting*.
charlie[laugh]: And on day four, Hanbi-hyung just handed me a charger. Didn't say anything. Mine was on two percent. I hadn't told anyone.
charlie: And Hamin-hyung saved me a seat at dinner. And Daniel-hyung started stealing my jokes, which is basically a hug.
charlie[smile]: That was the first place I didn't have to hold the door. Somebody was already holding it. I just walked in.
* [sincere] "They love you. It's very obvious from the outside."
