songha: Reminder: lobby at 04:57. Not 04:58. That means you, Charlie.
hyunjun: is everyone on the roof?? can i come on the roof
haruta: Hyunjun, come and finish the film with me. I'll let you pick the snacks.
hanbi: Leave them be.
