    charlie[laugh]: No wonder neither of us ever answered anything.
> The truth is simpler and harder. You were always the one who left. New city, new school, new front desk. Always in spring.
> You got very good at arriving. Nobody ever taught you how to stay.
charlie: Okay, easier question. Out of all of them. Which one was your favourite?
