=== charlie_ending
@chapter ending
@bg studio_lobby t=fade
@music echo
@time 04:58
@textbox echo
echo: Record 04 selected. Owner: Charlie. Writing now.
@textbox normal
@cam pushin
> In the Archive Wall, box number four slides open by itself. A single glass card rises out of it, amber at the edges, warm as a cup.
> The photograph burns into it slowly. The board. Every DELAYED. And in the bottom corner, small and permanent now: a hand, pointing at a gate.
@cam wide
@show daniel laugh at=r
daniel: The *airport*. Of course. Not even surprised. They've been making Charlie noises on the roof for an hour.
@show hyunjun smile at=l
hyunjun: Charlie. Charlie. Are you crying?
@show charlie laugh at=c
charlie: No! The card's shiny! It's reflecting into my eyes! That's science!
@hide daniel hyunjun
@show songha smile at=l
songha: Noted. Charlie will be unbearable for approximately one week.
@show hanbi smile at=r
hanbi: …Two.
@hide songha hanbi
@show hamin smile at=l
hamin: Three. He's already planning how to tell the story.
@show haruta smile at=r
haruta: It's a good story, though. I'd watch it. Twice.
@hide hamin haruta
@show justin laugh at=l
justin: I'm choreographing the snack part.
charlie: Nobody is choreographing the snack part.
justin: The snack part is the entire piece.
@hide justin
> The card finishes glowing. Charlie picks it up the way you'd pick up something asleep.
charlie[smile]: It's warm. Why is it warm?
@textbox echo
echo: I kept it somewhere safe for five years. It has not had time to cool.
echo: Thank you, Charlie. Thank you, {{playerName}}. It was a good record to keep.
@textbox normal
@call echo_farewell
@bg dawn_river t=slow d=2.6
@music charlie
@amb birds
@fx light n=0.6
@time 05:52
@cam reveal
