> The others went ahead to find breakfast. Songha sent a pin. Charlie said "we'll catch up," in a voice that clearly meant "eventually."
> The water is pale gold and very still. A cyclist goes past. A man walks a small dog that wants to meet everyone.
@show charlie smile at=c
